{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " αὐτός (Cret. ἀvτός "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "GDI 4976", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.), αὐτή, αὐτό (also "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτόν Leg.Gort. 3.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.), reflexive Pron., self:—in oblique cases used for the personal Pron., him, her, it:—with Art., ὁ αὐτός, ἡ αὐτή, τὸ αὐτό (also ταὐτόν), etc., the very one, the same. self, myself, thyself, etc., acc. to the person of the Verb: freq. joined with ἐγώ, σύ, etc. (v. infr. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "10", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "), one's true self, the soul, not the body, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 11.602", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; reversely, body, not soul, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.4", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; oneself, as opp. others who are less prominent, as king to subject, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "6.18", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; Zeus to other gods, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "8.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; bird to young, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2.317", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; man to wife and children, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 14.265", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; warrior to horses, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 2.466", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", or to weapons, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.47", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; shepherd to herd, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.167", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.51", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; Trojans to allies, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "11.220", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; seamen to ships, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "7.338", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": generally, whole to parts, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "474", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; so later "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡ σίδη καὶ αὐτὴ καὶ τὰ φύλλα Thphr. HP 4.10.7", "author_abbreviation": "Thphr.", "tlg_author": "0093", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Ath. 1.19", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "015", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Grg. 511e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτή τε Μανδάνη καὶ τὸν υἱὸν ἔχουσα X. Cyr. 1.3.1", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐ. τε καὶ τὰ ποιήματα βουλόμενος ἐπιδεῖξαι Pl. R. 398a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": abs., the Master, as in the "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pythag.", "author_abbreviation": "Pythag.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " phrase Αὐτὸς ἔφα, Lat. Ipse dixit; so τίς οὗτος . . ;— Αὐτός, i.e. Socrates, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Nu. 218", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀναβόησον Αὐτόν ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "219", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀνοιγέτω τις δώματ'· Αὐτὸς ἔρχεται the Master, Id. Fr. 268", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Prt. 314d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Thphr. Char. 2.4", "author_abbreviation": "Thphr.", "tlg_author": "0093", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Men. Sam. 41", "author_abbreviation": "Men.", "tlg_author": "0541", "tlg_work": "029", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐ. ἀϋτεῖ Theoc. 24.50", "author_abbreviation": "Theoc.", "tlg_author": "0005", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": neut., αὐτὸ σημανεῖ the result will show, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Ph. 623", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "015", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸ δηλώσει D. 19.157", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὰ δηλοῖ Pl. Prt. 329b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὸ διδάξει ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "324a", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; esp. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸ δείξει Cratin. 177", "author_abbreviation": "Cratin.", "tlg_author": "0434", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Hp.Ma. 288b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "025", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Tht. 200e", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; in full, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τάχ' αὐτὸ δείξει τοὔργον S. Fr. 388", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοὔργον τάχ' αὐτὸ δείξει Ar. Lys. 375", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; redupl., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτός θ' ὁ χρήσας αὐτὸς ἦν ὁ μαρτυρῶν A. Eu. 798", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; of things, the very, ὑπὸ λόφον αὐτόν, i.e. just, exactly under . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 13.615", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; πρὸς αὐταῖς ταῖς θύραις close by the door, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lys. 12.12", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὸ τὸ δέον the very thing needed, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. An. 4.7.7", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸ ὃ μάλιστα ἔδει ῥηθῆναι Pl. R. 362d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὸ τὸ περίορθρον the point of dawn, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 2.3", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὰ τὰ ἐναντία the very opposite, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Mem. 4.5.7", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὰ τὰ χρήσιμα καὶ ἀναγκαῖα D.H. Th. 23", "author_abbreviation": "D.H.", "tlg_author": "0081", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; even, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὔ μοι μέλει ἄλγος οὔτ' αὐτῆς Ἑκάβης Il. 6.451", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἴ περ ἂν αὐταὶ Μοῦσαι ἀείδοιεν 2.597", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ".—In these senses αὐτός in Prose either precedes both the Art. and Subst., or follows both, e.g. αὐτὸς ὁ υἱός or ὁ υἱὸς αὐτός. The Art. is sts. omitted with proper names, or Nouns denoting individuals, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸς Μένων X. An. 2.1.5", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὸς βασιλεύς ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.7.11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". of oneself, of one's own accord, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀλλά τις αὐ. ἴτω Il. 17.254", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σπεύδοντα καὶ αὐτὸν ὀτρύνεις 8.293", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καταπαύσομεν· οἱ δὲ καὶ αὐτοὶ παυέσθων Od. 2.168", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἥξει γὰρ αὐτά S. OT 341", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also, in person, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῶν πραγμάτων ὑμῖν . . αὐτοῖς ἀντιληπτέον D. 1.2", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". by oneself or itself, alone, αὐτός περ ἐών although alone, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 8.99", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὸς ἐγείναο παῖδ', i.e. without a mother, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "5.880", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hes. Th. 924", "author_abbreviation": "Hes.", "tlg_author": "0020", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀνακομισθῆναι αὐτὸν ἐς Φάληρον by himself, Hdt. 5.85", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτοὶ γάρ ἐσμεν we are by ourselves, i.e. among friends, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ach. 504", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 472", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "008", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Prm. 137b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Herod. 6.70", "author_abbreviation": "Herod.", "tlg_author": "0650", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Plu. 2.755c", "author_abbreviation": "Plu.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Luc. DDeor. 10.2", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "068", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτοῖς τοῖς ἀνδράσι . . ἢ καὶ τοῖς ἄλλοις X. An. 2.3.7", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄνευ τοῦ σίτου τὸ ὄψον αὐτὸ ἐσθίειν Id. Mem. 3.14.3", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν τρίβωνα ὃν αὐτὸν φορεῖ Thphr. Char. 22.13", "author_abbreviation": "Thphr.", "tlg_author": "0093", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (prob.); αὐτὰ γὰρ ἔστιν ταῦτα these and no others, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Emp. 21.13", "author_abbreviation": "Emp.", "tlg_author": "1342", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.: strengthd., αὐτὸς κτήσατο οἶος himself alone, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 14.450", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτὸς μόνος, v. μόνος II; αὐτὸς καθ' αὑτόν, v. ἑαυτοῦ. in Philosophy, by or in itself, of an abstract concept or idea, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δίκαιον αὐτό Pl. Phd. 65d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸ τὸ ἕν Id. Prm. 143a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al., cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arist. Metaph. 997b8", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "025", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": neut., αὐτό is freq. in this sense, attached to Nouns of all genders, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐκ αὐτὸ δικαιοσύνην ἐπαινοῦντες ἀλλὰ τὰς ἀπ' αὐτῆς εὐδοκιμήσεις Pl. R. 363a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; less freq. with Art., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τί ποτ' ἐστὶν αὐτὸ ἡ ἀρετή Id. Prt. 360e", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; more fully, εἰ αὐτὸ τοῦτο πατέρα ἠρώτων, ἆρα ὁ πατήρ ἐστι πατήρ τινος, ἢ οὔ; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. Smp. 199d", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀδελφός, αὐτὸ τοῦτο ὅπερ ἔστιν the ideal, abstract brother, ibid.e: later, in compos., αὐτοαγαθόν, αὐτοάνθρωπος, etc. (q. v.), cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Arist. Metaph. 1040b33", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "025", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; less freq. agreeing with the Subst., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἵνα αὐτὴ δικαιοσύνη πρὸς ἀδικίαν αὐτὴν κριθείη Pl. R. 612c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; doubled, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐκ τῆς εἰκόνος μανθάνειν αὐτήν τε αὐτήν, εἰ καλῶς εἴκασται its very self, Id. Cra. 439a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in dat. with Subst., in one, together, ἀνόρουσεν αὐτῇ σὺν φόρμιγγι he sprang up lyre in hand, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 9.194", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτῇ σὺν πήληκι κάρη helmet and all, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "14.498", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 13.118", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτῷ σὺν ἄγγει E. Ion 32", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hipp. 1213", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also without "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "σύν, αὐτῇ κεν γαίῃ ἐρύσαι Il. 8.24", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": so freq. in Prose and Poetry, αὐτοῖς ἀνδράσι men and all, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 6.93", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; αὐτοῖσι συμμάχοισι allies and all, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pr. 223", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (lyr.); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτοῖς μελάθροις διακναιομένους E. Med. 164", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": with Art., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτοῖσι τοῖσι ἱματίοισι ἀπ' ὦν ἔβαψε ἑωυτόν Hdt. 2.47", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "