kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπὶ τὸ αὐ. αἱ γνῶμαι ἔφερον Id. 1.79", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": " : c. dat., to denote sameness or agreement, esp. in Prose, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὠυτὸ ἂν ὑμῖν ἐπρήσσομεν Hdt. 4.119", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸν αὐτὸν χῶρον ἐκλιπὼν ἐμοί A. Ch. 543", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὁ αὐτὸς τῷ λίθῳ the same as the stone, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Euthd. 298a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐν ταὐτῷ εἶναί τινι to be in the place with . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. An. 3.1.27", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; προσίεσθαί τινα ἐς ταὐτὸ ἑαυτῷ to have a person meet one, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "30", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Ch. 210", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κατὰ ταὐτὰ τῷ Νείλῳ Hdt. 2.20", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῇ αὐτῇ . . καί Id. 4.109", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὴν αὐτὴν διάνοιαν καὶ κατ' ἐκείνην ἡλικίαν Isoc. 5.83", "author_abbreviation": "Isoc.", "tlg_author": "0010", "tlg_work": "020", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁ αὐτός . . ὥσπερ Pl. Phd. 86a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς ταὐτὸν ἀλλήλοις face to face, Jul. Or. 2.5a0", "author_abbreviation": "Jul.", "tlg_author": "2003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Ion."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in later Greek, the said, the above-named, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ἡρώδης ὁ αὐ. PLille 23.8", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (iii B. C.), etc. Adverbial phrases: "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸ μόνον simply, merely, Ph. 2.252", "author_abbreviation": "Ph.", "tlg_author": "0018", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐ. μόνον ἐργάτης Luc. Somn. 9", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "029", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐ. μόνον τὸ ὄνομα τῆς φωνῆς A.D. Synt. 22.20", "author_abbreviation": "A.D.", "tlg_author": "0082", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". αὐτό as Adv., = ἄρτι , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Epigr.Gr. 540.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Thrace). αὐτὸ τοῦτο as Adv., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PGrenf. 1.114", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (ii B. C.), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2 Ep.Pet. 1.5", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῆς αὐτὸ τοῦτο κινουμένης σφαίρας Iamb. Comm.Math. 17", "author_abbreviation": "Iamb.", "tlg_author": "2023", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". with Preps., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπὶ τὸ αὐτό added together, making a total, PLond. 2.196.37", "author_abbreviation": "PLond.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (ii A. D.); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κατὰ τὸ αὐτό together, at the same time, Act.Ap. 14.1", "author_abbreviation": "Act.Ap.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; but "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κατ' αὐτό just then, Hdn. 1.12.3", "author_abbreviation": "Hdn.", "tlg_author": "0015", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". In Compos.: of or by oneself, self- . . , as in αὐτοδίδακτος, αὐτογνώμων, αὐτόματος: and so, independently, as in αὐτοκράτωρ, αὐτόνομος. hence, as a second self, very . . , bodily, as with proper names, Αὐτοθαΐς. in the abstract, the ideal, v. supr."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.4", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0015", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". precisely, as in αὐτόδεκα. rarely with reflex. sense of ἀλλήλων, as in αὐτοκτονέω. in one piece with, together with, as in αὐτόκωπος, αὐτοχείλης, αὐτόπρεμνος, αὐτόρριζος. by itself: hence, only, as in αὐτόξυλος, αὐτόποκος.—For αὐτοῦ, αὐτῶς, etc., v. the respective Arts. "}]}